        "en": "Reviewers praise the positive, psychology-based methodology used to address canine reactivity and fear without harsh corrections. Owners note that trainers build genuine bonds with sensitive dogs, helping them become calm and confident around guests and children. A critical reviewer felt the approach was poorly suited for cats."
